    "created_at": "2018-11-19T10:05:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-19T10:05:03Z",
    "body": "I agree that ratio of width/height is a bad idea, and -webkti-appearance:slider-vertical is also a bad idea.\r\n\r\nI'd be happy if UA can detect orientation with DOM level information such as content attribute because the current range implementation in Blink uses shadow nodes and updating shadow nodes style  depending on the host style needs a hack.\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
