    "created_at": "2024-01-18T11:50:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-18T11:51:56Z",
    "body": "The HTML specification is confusing in its description of vertical rendering, and in any case, I think the specification should be updated as soon as possible, as said [here](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#range-state-(type=range)) again:\r\n\r\n> Note how the UA determined the orientation of the control from the ratio of the style-sheet-specified height and width properties. \r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/whatwg/html/assets/2784308/8ea55ccc-d6b9-4592-9039-3ac0a11138dc)\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
