    "created_at": "2024-01-18T11:57:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-18T11:57:45Z",
    "body": "There is a wide demand for a vertical input range community:\r\n\r\n- https://stackoverflow.com/questions/15935837/how-to-display-a-range-input-slider-vertically\r\n- https://stackoverflow.com/questions/24369879/styling-a-vertical-html5-range-input\r\n- https://stackoverflow.com/questions/65132988/making-range-slider-vertical\r\n\r\nVertical input ranges are also very common in cell phone operating systems. For example, iOS:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/whatwg/html/assets/2784308/d55d04eb-d0b5-4747-96b2-e2d3b042c19a)\r\n\r\nThe confusion of the specification brings poor interoperability and we need to reach a consensus as soon as possible. I prefer having a CSS property to control direction.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
